lectric Global Internship 2026 in Japan (Fully Funded)\n\nThe Internship is open to all Nationals.Citizens from all around the world are eligible for the GIST South Korea Internship.Open to international undergraduate seniors or Master’s degree students.A minimum GPA of 3.0 (on a 4.5 scale) or equivalent.Students who are citizens of an English-speaking country or whose primary language of instruction at their university is English may submit a copy of their passport or a certificate stating “Medium of Instruction is English”.\n\nAlso Check:GRIPS Summer Research Internship 2026 in China (Fully Funded)\n\nOfficial Degree Certificates (e.g., diploma, enrollment/graduation certificate)Official Transcripts (in English)Letter of RecommendationEnglish Proficiency Proof\n\nHow to Apply for the GIST Global Internship 2026?\n\nApplicants have to apply online from the official website. Create an account with your email address. The Link to the official website is below. For more fully funded Good International Internships, kindly check out theInternship Category.\n\nVISIT HERE TO APPLY FOR A GIST INTERNSHIP IN SOUTH KOREA	\N	2026-02-02 17:49:34.49104	t	2026-02-02 17:49:34.49104	\N
